  "title": "Red Cabbage and Apples",
  "description": "This is a memorable combination, especially when all warm and bubbly. There &#39;s sugar for sweetness and vinegar for a bit of sour, and lots of cabbage and thinly sliced apples. Makes two generous servings.",
